/about/contactus/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="Contact Us"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-2-5"></span></i><span>Contact Us</span></a></li><li><a href="/en/page/about/aboutus/" aria-label="account" data-tag-name="About Us"><i class="icon-outer"><span class="icon-2-6"></span></i><span>About Us</span></a></li></ul></section></div></div></div></div></div><div class="header-middle"><div class="header-center header-middle-main"><ul class="header-nav"><li class="nav-item home"><a href="/en/page/homepage" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="drop-down" target="_self" class="nav-text">HOME</a></li><li class="nav-item express"><a href="/en/page/transport/" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="drop-down" target="_self" class="nav-text">FORWARDING</a></li><li class="nav-item business"><a href="https://www.buckydrop.com/en/?pr=5XFWE&prc=W2V1V&utm_source=superbuy&utm_medium=referral&utm_content=website-navigation" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="drop-down" target="_blank" class="nav-text">DROPSHIPPING</a></li><li class="nav-item partner"><a href="/en/page/about/affiliate/" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="drop-down" target="_self" class="nav-text">AFFILIATES</a></li><li class="nav-item pricing"><a href="/en/page/guide/feecomposition" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="drop-down" target="_self" class="nav-text">PRICING</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ant-spin-nested-loading global-spin"><div class="ant-spin-container"><div class="about-us-wrap"><div class="about-nav-wrap"><div class="aboutNav"><h2>About Superbuy</h2><ul><li><a href="/en/page/about/aboutus/">About Superbuy</a></li><li><a href="/en/page/about/contactus/">Contact Us</a></li><li><a href="/en/page/about/agreement/">Terms of Service</a></li><li><a href="/en/page/help/#search_helpId1162">Privacy Statement</a></li><li><a href="/en/page/about/registration/">Merchant Center</a></li><li><a href="/en/page/about/link/">Useful links</a></li><li><a href="/en/page/about/map/">Website Map</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="about-us en"><h2 class="about-logo"><a href="/en/page/homepage" class="logo-inner" title="HOME"></a></h2><div class="am-body" style="transform: translate3d(0px, 0%, 0px);" id="onePage"><div class="am-page video-area" id="videoContainer"><div class="am-bg am-videoPlayer"><video autoplay class="video-player" controls loop poster="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/video_bg.jpg" preload="none" src="//superbuy-front-end.superbuy.com/media/aboutus_en.mp4" style="width: 1920px; height: 1080px; left: -10px; top: -90px;"></video></div><div class="video-text" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/logo_text_en.png?v=1");'></div></div><div class="am-page"><div class="story-slide"><h3 class="main-title animated" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/SUPERBUY_STORY.png");'>SUPERBUY STORY</h3><ul class="slide-list" style="left: 0%; width: 400%;"><li class="slide-item animated"><div class="slide-text clearfix animated"><h4 class="title">WHO</h4><p class="text">Superbuy founded in 2012, builds the most prestigious platform for overseas users to shop online Chinese goods with ease.</p><p class="text">Superbuy is an Internet-based platform where global users can enjoy easy access to one-stop services ranging from purchasing, order fulfillment, quality inspection, international shipping (through third-party couriers) to after-sales. Currently, users can shop from over 20 well-known Chinese e-commerce platforms on Superbuy, and a variety of quality service providers have partnered with Superbuy to help all users to shop from China easier than ever before!</p></div><div class="slide-img img-1 animated" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/2_who.png");'></div><div class="slide-img img-2" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/2_who_1.png");'></div></li><li class="slide-item animated fadeOut"><div class="slide-text clearfix animated"><h4 class="title">WHAT</h4><p class="text">Quality shopping agent, warehousing, quality inspection, and parcel forwarding services that will solve all your problems when purchasing Chinese products online.</p><p class="text">Helps users abroad purchase Chinese products with peace of mind.</p></div><div class="slide-img img-1 animated" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/2_what.png");'></div></li><li class="slide-item animated fadeOut"><div class="slide-text clearfix animated"><h4 class="title">WHY</h4><p class="text">Professional shopping agent service with free standard services. We will deliver Chinese products to you no matter where you are.</p><p class="text">9/7 (09:00-18:00, BJ Time) Online Bilingual Customer Service and CEO Direct Email to help you shop from China worry-free!</p></div><div class="slide-img img-1 animated" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/3_why.png");'></div></li><li class="slide-item animated fadeOut"><div class="slide-text clearfix animated"><h4 class="title">HOW</h4><p class="text">When you want to purchase Chinese products from a foreign country, you just need to log into the Superbuy website or download the APP. Just paste the link of the product or enter the name of the product in the search bar, you will be able to purchase the product you want. After the product arrives at Superbuy’s warehouse, submit the parcel and the parcel will be forwarded to you.</p><p class="text text-right"><a href="/en/page/newguide/shoppingagent/" class="more-href" target="_blank">TRY NOW ></a></p></div><div class="slide-img img-1 animated" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/2_how.png");'></div></li></ul><div class="slide-img img-defualt animated" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/2_1.png");'></div><div class="triangle-img" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/triangle.png");'></div><div class="btn-common-wrap animated"><p class="story-pagination">1/4</p><i class="story-slide-next"></i></div></div></div><div class="am-page"><div class="business-slide"><ul class="slide-list"><li class="slide-item"><div class="slide-img" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/s-1-1.jpg");'></div><div class="slide-mask"></div><div class="slide-text"><h4 class="title">Shopping Agent</h4><p class="text">Free standard shopping agent services and a wide selection of products.</p></div></li><li class="slide-item"><div class="slide-img" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/s-2-2.jpg");'></div><div class="slide-mask"></div><div class="slide-text"><h4 class="title">Parcel Forwarding</h4><p class="text">Forward Chinese products to any place in the world at prices lower than direct shipping.</p></div></li><li class="slide-item"><div class="slide-img" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/s-3-3.jpg");'></div><div class="slide-mask"></div><div class="slide-text"><h4 class="title">Warehousing</h4><p class="text">Photos that show the true condition of products, professional packing and quality inspection services.</p></div></li><li class="slide-item"><div class="slide-img" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/s-4-4.jpg");'></div><div class="slide-mask"></div><div class="slide-text"><h4 class="title">Logistics Services</h4><p class="text">Ready solutions for overweight/oversized parcels and customized shipping plans.</p></div></li><li class="slide-item"><div class="slide-img" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/s-5-5.jpg");'></div><div class="slide-mask"></div><div class="slide-text"><h4 class="title">Business Services</h4><p class="text">One-stop e-commerce supply chain solutions for global e-commerce clients.</p></div></li><li class="slide-item"><div class="slide-img" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/s-6-6.jpg");'></div><div class="slide-mask"></div><div class="slide-text"><h4 class="title">Affiliate Program</h4><p class="text">Invite new users to earn bonus.</p></div></li><li class="slide-item"><div class="slide-img" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/s-8-8.jpg");'></div><div class="slide-mask"></div><div class="slide-text"><h4 class="title">Expert Sourcing</h4><p class="text">Customized shopping experience. Bilingual expert service. Purchase from multiple platforms.</p></div></li><li class="slide-item"><div class="slide-img" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/s-9-9.jpg");'></div><div class="slide-mask"></div><div class="slide-text"><h4 class="title">BuckyDrop</h4><p class="text">A robust e-commerce system that helps you start your cross-border e-commerce business.</p></div></li></ul><div class="business-pop animated pop-bg-colorundefined none"><a href="javaScript:;" class="close-pop">&lt; Return</a><div class="bg" style='background-image: url("undefined");'></div><div class="pop-text"><h4 class="title"></h4></div><a class="btn-common-wrap" target="_blank">Try Now</a></div></div></div><div class="am-page"><div class="user-global"><div class="bg bg1 animated" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/user_global/user_bg1.png"); animation-delay: 0.2s;'></div><div class="bg bg2 animated" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/user_global/user_bg2.png"); animation-delay: 0.4s;'></div><div class="bg bg3 animated" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/user_global/user_bg3.png"); animation-delay: 0.6s;'></div><div class="bg bg4 animated" style='background-image: url("https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/about/aboutus/user_global/user_bg4.png"); animation-delay: 0.8s;'></div><div class="user-content animated"><h3 class="main-title">Superbuy Users from Around the World</h3><ul class="comment-list page1 z-index-113"><li class="comment-item position1 animated" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user1"></i><a class="comment-text right undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">lagiop12j<i class="icon-flag icon-flag5"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">My first experience with Superbuy was amazing, the transaction was smooth and fast. While I am still waiting for my order, I have already reccomended Superbuy to alot of my friends. Thanks Superbuy!</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position2 animated" style="animation-delay: 0.8s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user3"></i><a class="comment-text left undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">andrewa<i class="icon-flag icon-flag1"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">AMAZING! Vacuum Seal was perfect. Everything in good condition. Fast Service.</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position3 animated" style="animation-delay: 1.4s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user1"></i><a class="comment-text left undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">jdr928<i class="icon-flag icon-flag5"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">出国快两年啦，各种想念国内好吃的，去年经好友介绍，通过Superbuy吃到了国内的各种美食，生活质量大大提升，幸福感直线飙升~！</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position4 animated" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user11"></i><a class="comment-text right undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">leo<i class="icon-flag icon-flag11"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">Chegou na minha casa em 16 dias, e não fui taxado. Com certeza comprarei mais vezes.</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position5 animated" style="animation-delay: 1s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user2"></i><a class="comment-text right undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">sgwwan14<i class="icon-flag icon-flag4"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">其实Superbuy是我用的第二个代购软件，你是最好的代购公司，真的是非常方便和靠谱，才选择第二次第三次的代购。</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position6 animated" style="animation-delay: 0.8s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user4"></i><a class="comment-text left undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">pirecat<i class="icon-flag icon-flag2"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">Goods carefully placed within box in a clever way to save space. The box is nice and tight sealed.Parcel preparation and shipping where blazing fast and one hour after my parcel order, the box was on its way to the logistic platform !</p><p class="text">Tax free line experience for this parcel : "Don't worry we take care of everything" and "Wow i can't believe it is already there !" 6 days from shipping order to the Home !! Thank-You Superbuy !</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position7 animated" style="animation-delay: 0.6s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user1"></i><a class="comment-text left undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">tona<i class="icon-flag icon-flag12"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">前向きな本日お荷物全部受け取りました。台風の中、どうもありがとうございました。</p><p class="text">また、宜しくお願い申し上げます。</p><p class="text">TEXPART　堀　昌代</p></div></a></li></ul><ul class="comment-list page2"><li class="comment-item position1 animated hide" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user6"></i><a class="comment-text right undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">sanakura<i class="icon-flag icon-flag5"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">I discovered Superbuy since March 2018 and has been using it everyday and shipping packages to US very week for my business. So far I have spend $10,000 on Superbuy and planning to spend more for my business. I love Superbuy.</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position2 animated hide" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user1"></i><a class="comment-text left undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">Berkli<i class="icon-flag icon-flag7"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">merci à toute l'équipe</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position3 animated hide" style="animation-delay: 0.6s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user8"></i><a class="comment-text right undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">happymatti<i class="icon-flag icon-flag6"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">从一群留学生里知道了Superbuy 于是带着试试的心情够买了宝宝的分腿睡袋 还有一些中式的东东 从购买到收到包裹 的心一直都是悬着的 各种糟糕的想法都🈶 当包裹📦到达的那一刻 哇塞 无法形容的开心 特别感谢Superbuy的每一位员工 真的特别棒</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position4 animated hide" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user7"></i><a class="comment-text left change-right" target="_blank"><p class="text">又笨又懒<i class="icon-flag icon-flag5"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">瑞雪兆丰年，祝Superbuy新年新气象，像这场暴风雪横扫美东一样，生意遍布全世界！</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position5 animated hide" style="animation-delay: 0.8s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user1"></i><a class="comment-text right undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">nicehand<i class="icon-flag icon-flag5"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">蓦然回首，从dotdotbuy到Superbuy, 不知不觉过过了5个年头。</p><p class="text">异国他乡的岁月里，依然能吃到家乡的美味，触摸到家乡的温暖。</p><p class="text">感谢Superbuy的小小编儿和所有的小哥哥小姐姐们。</p><p class="text">你们是我心里最美最帅的人！</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position6 animated hide" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user9"></i><a class="comment-text left undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">Tze Xuan<i class="icon-flag icon-flag3"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">有你才有我！才有了这些蛋糕面包的，因为都是Superbuy帮我运输器具模具的，谢谢你们。</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position7 animated hide" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user10"></i><a class="comment-text left undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">HelenChen<i class="icon-flag icon-flag8"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">辛苦Superbuy為大眾服務 感激有你們</p></div></a></li></ul><ul class="comment-list page3"><li class="comment-item position1 animated hide" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user11"></i><a class="comment-text hide-more left change-right" target="_blank"><p class="text">一斤Huu<i class="icon-flag icon-flag5"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">第一次听说Superbuy是在美妆博主Rainie和Vicky的视频里。作为淘宝资深买家，在美国实在是怀念可以在淘宝买买买的日子，Superbuy实现了这一步。当我了解到海外转运服务的时候，我了解到多种途径，细一步调查后，我发现Superbuy的性价比是最高的。正规的步骤，详细的服务，24小时客服和可靠的品牌让我非常放心。和淘宝无缝连接让我清楚地了解到我的商品进行到哪一步了，所以Superbuy成为我转运服务的首选平台，并被我成功推荐给其他朋友。</p><p class="text">今年六月是我的高中毕业典礼，在美国找不到合适的高跟鞋，于是用Superbuy转运了人生第一双高跟鞋，鞋子很满意，Superbuy的拍照服务也很让人放心，更重要的是完美在毕业典礼前送达。</p><p class="text">作为学生党，同样价格在美国却买不到相近款式和质量的衣服，冬天即将来临，我又要下单了冬天的衣服，期待这一次的转运服务。</p><p class="text">五月，我参与了superlove话题，并荣幸地获得了三等奖，让我获得了积分和优惠券。</p><p class="text">感谢Superbuy提供这么好的机会和丰厚的奖品，祝Superbuy六岁生日快乐，越办越好！</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position2 animated hide" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user12"></i><a class="comment-text right undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">corfield1988<i class="icon-flag icon-flag4"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">Very quick delivery and excellent packing .</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position3 animated hide" style="animation-delay: 0.6s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user1"></i><a class="comment-text right undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">niktkah06<i class="icon-flag icon-flag10"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">Gracias amigos.</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position4 animated hide" style="animation-delay: 0.8s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user1"></i><a class="comment-text right undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">蛋蛋的壳<i class="icon-flag icon-flag1"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">非常满意这次的购物经历！便宜又快速</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position5 animated hide" style="animation-delay: 1s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user13"></i><a class="comment-text right undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">EmEm<i class="icon-flag icon-flag1"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">祝願Superbuy收穫更多的忠實用家，越來越好，繼續發光發亮，Getting better and better!!!</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position6 animated hide" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user14"></i><a class="comment-text right undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">Jennijkh<i class="icon-flag icon-flag5"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">Superbuy is probably the best service so far when purchasing things from taobao. Great service & fast shipping!</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position7 animated hide" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;"><i class="user-pic icon-user16"></i><a class="comment-text left undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">Ahmad<i class="icon-flag icon-flag3"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">Sangat gembira! Terima Kasih SF!</p></div></a></li><li class="comment-item position8 animated hide"><i class="user-pic icon-user15"></i><a class="comment-text left undefined" target="_blank"><p class="text">sean092121<i class="icon-flag icon-flag9"></i>:</p><div class="text-wrap"><p class="text">我是這個月初使用的，Superbuy,真的是一個特優的網站。</p><p class="text">不但可以代購各大網站的商品，而且又有返利給您。</p><p class="text">加上人在台灣，無法充值支付寶，微信，還好有Superbuy 的虛擬代充服務，給我很大的方便。</p><p class="text">透過代購賣了藍光DVD, 也利用了轉運其他貨物，合併寄送的服務。</p><p class="text">我會繼續使用，並介紹給我的朋友們。</p></div></a></li></ul></div><div class="user-global-pagination"><a href="javascript:;" aria-label="global-pagination-0" class="active"><i class="dotted"></i></a><a href="javascript:;" aria-label="global-pagination-1" class=""><i class="dotted"></i></a><a href="javascript:;" aria-label="global-pagination-2" class=""><i class="dotted"></i></a></div></div></div><div class="am-page"></div></div><div class="onepage-pagination"><a href="javascript:;" aria-label="onepage-pagination-0" class="active"><i class="dotted"></i></a><a href="javascript:;" aria-label="onepage-pagination-1" class=""><i class="dotted"></i></a><a href="javascript:;" aria-label="onepage-pagination-2" class=""><i class="dotted"></i></a><a href="javascript:;" aria-label="onepage-pagination-3" class=""><i class="dotted"></i></a><a href="javascript:;" aria-label="onepage-pagination-4" class=""><i class="dotted"></i></a></div><a href="javascript:;" aria-label="go-next" class="go-next"></a></div></div></div></div></div><div><aside class="m-tool-bar m-tool-bar-en tool-bar-show"><section class="beijing-time-bar"><p>UTC+8</p><p class="">Mar 3rd</p><p class="cur-time" translate="no">17:08:08</p></section><ul><li id="discord" translate="no"><a href="" aria-label="discord" target="_blank"><i class="font-icon"></i></a></li><li class="" id="tool-bar-QRCode"><a href="/en/page/download" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="QRCode" target="_blank"><i class="tool-bar-icon tool-bar-icon-app"></i><div class="sub-text"><img alt="QRCode" class="qr-code" src="https://cdn.superbuy.com/starit-superbuy/dist/cn/source/img/wrapper/toolbar/QRCode_en.png"><p class="download-text">Download APP</p><div class="QRCode-bottom"><span>Collect CN￥ 560 New User Gift</span></div></div></a></li><li id="tool-bar-shop-cart"><a href="javascript:void(0);" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="shop cart"><i class="tool-bar-icon tool-bar-icon-shop-cart"></i><div class="sub-text"></div></a></li><li class="service-button"><a href="javascript:void(0);" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="bar-service"><i class="tool-bar-icon-online tool-bar-icon"></i><div cl